The JSON files in this directory are answers of the Pokémon TCG API v2 (https://pokemontcg.io,
https://api.pokemontcg.io/v2), recorded on 2026-10-10: `sets.json` (GET /v2/sets, only the fields
the importer reads) and the cards of three sets (GET /v2/cards?q=set.id:<id>, reduced to id, name,
number and images; `cards-swsh45sv.json` to three cards).

